@4 took a step forward, intent on examining the strange device before him.
"No!" cried @3, grabbing his shoulder. "This is the rift machine we have been searching for. It is very dangerous and I would not advise getting too close."
@3 was nearly frantic. "We must devise a way to destroy this machine before Delekhan transports an entire ñarmy through here!"�

